  {
   "id": "ID_2024_TRAIT_ELF_DARKVISION",
   "name": "Darkvision",
   "type": "Racial Trait",
   "source": "SRD 5.2.1",
   "ruleset": "dnd2024",
   "description": "<p>You have Darkvision with a range of 60 feet.</p>",
   "rules": [
    {
     "kind": "grant",
     "id": "ID_VISION_DARKVISION",
     "type": "Vision"
    },
    {
     "kind": "stat",
     "name": "darkvision:range",
     "value": "60",
     "bonus": "base"
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "ID_2024_TRAIT_ELF_ELVEN_LINEAGE",
   "name": "Elven Lineage",
   "type": "Racial Trait",
   "source": "SRD 5.2.1",
   "ruleset": "dnd2024",
   "description": "<p>You are part of a lineage that grants you supernatural abilities. Choose a lineage from the Elven Lineages table. You gain the level 1 benefit of that lineage.</p>\n<p>When you reach character levels 3 and 5, you learn a higher-level spell, as shown on the table.</p>\n<p>You always have that spell prepared. You can cast it once without a spell slot, and you regain the ability to cast it in that way when you finish a Long Rest. You can also cast the spell using any spell slots you have of the appropriate level. Elven Lineages</p>\n<pre> Lineage     Level 1\nDrow         The range of your Darkvision increases to 120\n             You also know the Dancing Lights cantrip.\nHigh Elf     You know the Prestidigitation cantrip. Wheneve\n             a Long Rest, you can replace that cantrip with\n             cantrip from the Wizard spell list.\nWood Elf     Your Speed increases to 35 feet. You also kno\n             Druidcraft cantrip.</pre>\n<p>Intelligence, Wisdom, or Charisma is your spellcasting ability for the spells you cast with this trait (choose the ability when you select the lineage).</p><table><tr><th>Lineage</th><th>Level 1</th><th>Level 3</th><th>Level 5</th></tr><tr><td>Drow</td><td>The range of your Darkvision increases to 120 feet. You also know the Dancing Lights cantrip.</td><td>Faerie Fire</td><td>Darkness</td></tr><tr><td>High Elf</td><td>You know the Prestidigitation cantrip. Whenever you finish a Long Rest, you can replace that cantrip with a different cantrip from the Wizard spell list.</td><td>Detect Magic</td><td>Misty Step</td></tr><tr><td>Wood Elf</td><td>Your Speed increases to 35 feet. You also know the Druidcraft cantrip.</td><td>Longstrider</td><td>Pass without Trace</td></tr></table>",
   "rules": [
    {
     "kind": "select",
     "type": "Species Trait Option",
     "name": "Elven Lineage",
     "supports": "Elven Lineage"
    },
    {
     "kind": "select_param",
     "name": "Lineage Spellcasting Ability",
     "options": [
      "Intelligence",
      "Wisdom",
      "Charisma"
     ]
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "ID_2024_TRAIT_ELF_FEY_ANCESTRY",
   "name": "Fey Ancestry",
   "type": "Racial Trait",
   "source": "SRD 5.2.1",
   "ruleset": "dnd2024",
   "description": "<p>You have Advantage on saving throws you make to avoid or end the Charmed condition.</p>",
   "rules": [
    {
     "kind": "save_advantage",
     "against_condition": "charmed",
     "scope": "avoid_or_end"
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "ID_2024_TRAIT_ELF_KEEN_SENSES",
   "name": "Keen Senses",
   "type": "Racial Trait",
   "source": "SRD 5.2.1",
   "ruleset": "dnd2024",
   "description": "<p>You have proficiency in the Insight, Perception, or Survival skill.</p>",
   "rules": [
    {
     "kind": "select",
     "type": "Proficiency",
     "name": "Keen Senses",
     "supports": "ID_PROFICIENCY_SKILL_INSIGHT|ID_PROFICIENCY_SKILL_PERCEPTION|ID_PROFICIENCY_SKILL_SURVIVAL"
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "ID_2024_TRAIT_ELF_TRANCE",
   "name": "Trance",
   "type": "Racial Trait",
   "source": "SRD 5.2.1",
   "ruleset": "dnd2024",
   "description": "<p>You don’t need to sleep, and magic can’t put you to sleep. You can finish a Long Rest in 4 hours if you spend those hours in a trancelike meditation, during which you retain consciousness.</p>"
  },
  {
   "id": "ID_2024_OPTION_ELVEN_LINEAGE_DROW",
   "name": "Drow",
   "type": "Species Trait Option",
   "source": "SRD 5.2.1",
   "ruleset": "dnd2024",
   "supports": [
    "Elven Lineage"
   ],
   "description": "<p>The range of your Darkvision increases to 120 feet. You also know the Dancing Lights cantrip. Level 3 spell: Faerie Fire. Level 5 spell: Darkness.</p>",
   "rules": [
    {
     "kind": "grant",
     "id": "ID_VISION_DARKVISION",
     "type": "Vision"
    },
    {
     "kind": "stat",
     "name": "darkvision:range",
     "value": "120",
     "bonus": "base"
    },
    {
     "kind": "grant_spell",
     "spell": "ID_2024_SPELL_DANCING_LIGHTS",
     "mode": "known_cantrip",
     "ability": {
      "choice": [
       "intelligence",
       "wisdom",
       "charisma"
      ],
      "param": "Lineage Spellcasting Ability"
     }
    },
    {
     "kind": "grant_spell",
     "level": 3,
     "spell": "ID_2024_SPELL_FAERIE_FIRE",
     "mode": "always_prepared",
     "free_cast": {
      "uses": 1,
      "recharge": "long_rest"
     },
     "also_with_slots": true,
     "ability": {
      "param": "Lineage Spellcasting Ability"
     }
    },
    {
     "kind": "grant_spell",
     "level": 5,
     "spell": "ID_2024_SPELL_DARKNESS",
     "mode": "always_prepared",
     "free_cast": {
      "uses": 1,
      "recharge": "long_rest"
     },
     "also_with_slots": true,
     "ability": {
      "param": "Lineage Spellcasting Ability"
     }
    }
   ],
   "data": {
    "lineage": "Drow",
    "level_1_text": "The range of your Darkvision increases to 120 feet. You also know the Dancing Lights cantrip.",
    "level_3_spell": "Faerie Fire",
    "level_5_spell": "Darkness",
    "level_1_cantrips": [
     "Dancing Lights"
    ]
   }
  },
  {
   "id": "ID_2024_OPTION_ELVEN_LINEAGE_HIGH_ELF",
   "name": "High Elf",
   "type": "Species Trait Option",
   "source": "SRD 5.2.1",
   "ruleset": "dnd2024",
   "supports": [
    "Elven Lineage"
   ],
   "description": "<p>You know the Prestidigitation cantrip. Whenever you finish a Long Rest, you can replace that cantrip with a different cantrip from the Wizard spell list. Level 3 spell: Detect Magic. Level 5 spell: Misty Step.</p>",
   "rules": [
    {
     "kind": "cantrip_swap",
     "spell_list": "Wizard",
     "swap_on": "long_rest",
     "replaces": "Prestidigitation"
    },
    {
     "kind": "grant_spell",
     "spell": "ID_2024_SPELL_PRESTIDIGITATION",
     "mode": "known_cantrip",
     "ability": {
      "choice": [
       "intelligence",
       "wisdom",
       "charisma"
      ],
      "param": "Lineage Spellcasting Ability"
     }
    },
    {
     "kind": "grant_spell",
     "level": 3,
     "spell": "ID_2024_SPELL_DETECT_MAGIC",
     "mode": "always_prepared",
     "free_cast": {
      "uses": 1,
      "recharge": "long_rest"
     },
     "also_with_slots": true,
     "ability": {
      "param": "Lineage Spellcasting Ability"
     }
    },
    {
     "kind": "grant_spell",
     "level": 5,
     "spell": "ID_2024_SPELL_MISTY_STEP",
     "mode": "always_prepared",
     "free_cast": {
      "uses": 1,
      "recharge": "long_rest"
     },
     "also_with_slots": true,
     "ability": {
      "param": "Lineage Spellcasting Ability"
     }
    }
   ],
   "data": {
    "lineage": "High Elf",
    "level_1_text": "You know the Prestidigitation cantrip. Whenever you finish a Long Rest, you can replace that cantrip with a different cantrip from the Wizard spell list.",
    "level_3_spell": "Detect Magic",
    "level_5_spell": "Misty Step",
    "level_1_cantrips": [
     "Prestidigitation"
    ]
   }
  },
  {
   "id": "ID_2024_OPTION_ELVEN_LINEAGE_WOOD_ELF",
   "name": "Wood Elf",
   "type": "Species Trait Option",
   "source": "SRD 5.2.1",
   "ruleset": "dnd2024",
   "supports": [
    "Elven Lineage"
   ],
   "description": "<p>Your Speed increases to 35 feet. You also know the Druidcraft cantrip. Level 3 spell: Longstrider. Level 5 spell: Pass without Trace.</p>",
   "rules": [
